WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:01.958
Final inspection is done.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.980
Shipping is waiting. Who signs off before
the order goes out?

00:00:06.308 --> 00:00:10.828
With ICC Processes, open final inspection
and see who owns it.

00:00:11.091 --> 00:00:12.937
The map shows what happens next.

00:00:13.265 --> 00:00:17.371
If the part passes, quality signs off and
hands the order to shipping.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.350
If it fails, the team knows where to hold
it.

00:00:20.526 --> 00:00:23.067
The current work instruction is linked
right there.

00:00:23.395 --> 00:00:27.613
The same process can go into your audit
plan, and a new inspector can follow

00:00:27.613 --> 00:00:28.763
the steps in order.

00:00:29.047 --> 00:00:31.197
So when shipping asks, "Can this go?"

00:00:31.656 --> 00:00:33.328
Everyone knows who makes the call.

00:00:33.656 --> 00:00:37.130
Book a demo with ISO Certification
Consultants.
